- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/testutil/streaming.go` — `FakeStreamCmd`, `BuildFakeShellScript` helpers extracted from `claudecode/generate_streaming_test.go`. Exported so all 4 new agents reuse them.
- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/generate_streaming.go` — Codex `GenerateTextStreaming` + per-event stream struct + parser.
- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/generate_streaming_test.go` — tests.
