- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/testdata/stream_error.jsonl` — error envelope fixture.
- Same trio (.go + 2 testdata) for `geminicli`, `cursor`, `copilotcli`.

**Modify:**
- `cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/codex.go` — declare `StreamingTextGenerator: true` in capabilities (if it's a `CapabilityDeclarer`, otherwise no-op — built-ins don't need to declare).
- Same for the other 3 agent packages: confirm each has a `*Agent` receiver and `GenerateTextStreaming` will compile against it.
- `cmd/entire/cli/explain.go` — adjust `summaryProgressWriter.handle` so `PhaseFirstToken` rendering omits zero fields:
  - When `TTFTms == 0` AND `CachedInputTokens == 0` → `→ Provider responded -- generating...` (no parens block)
  - When only `TTFTms == 0` → `→ Provider responded (Nk cached input tokens) -- generating...`
  - When only `CachedInputTokens == 0` → `→ Provider responded (TTFT 1.6s) -- generating...`
  - When both present → existing format unchanged.

**Not modified:**
